                "title": "payer_contract_summary.docx",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Payer Contract Summary: Denials and Appeals\n3. Payer terms\n\nMedicare, **Plan type** = Original Medicare (fee-for-service). Medicare, **First-level appeal window** = 120 days from the date of the denial notice. Medicare, **Where to file** = Medicare Administrative Contractor, redetermination request. Medicare, **Second-level appeal** = 180 days from the redetermination decision. Medicare, **Timely filing of new claims** = 12 months from the date of service. Northstar Advantage, **Plan type** = Medicare Advantage health plan. Northstar Advantage, **First-level appeal window** = 60 days from the date of the denial notice. Northstar Advantage, **Where to file** = Plan appeals portal. Northstar Advantage, **Second-level appeal** = 60 days from the plan's reconsideration decision, to the independent review entity. Northstar Advantage, **Timely filing of new claims** = 180 days from the date of service. Medicaid, **Plan type** = State Medicaid managed care. Medicaid, **First-level appeal window** = 90 days from the date of the denial notice. Medicaid, **Where to file** = Managed care organization appeals unit. Medicaid, **Second-level appeal** = State fair hearing within 120 days of the appeal decision. Medicaid, **Timely filing of new claims** = 180 days from the date of service. Evergreen Health Plan, **Plan type** = Commercial PPO. Evergreen Health Plan, **First-level appeal window** = 180 days from the date of the denial notice. Evergreen Health Plan, **Where to file** = Provide",
                "metadata": {
                  "parser": "docling-docx",
                  "file_id": "f-e59444b13b07179b",
                  "file_name": "payer_contract_summary.docx",
