                "title": "payer_contract_summary.docx",
                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Payer Contract Summary: Denials and Appeals\n4. Working a denial\n1. Denials Management reads each denial notice within 3 business days and assigns a reason code.\n2. Denials that can be corrected (a coding error, incomplete documentation, a duplicate) are corrected and resubmitted as corrected claims where the payer allows, which does not use up the appeal window.\n3. For any denial that needs an appeal, the appeal is filed no later than 10 days before the window closes, with a letter of medical necessity where relevant.\n4. The claim's appeal status is updated when the appeal is filed and again when the payer decides.",
