                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Payer Contract Summary: Denials and Appeals\n5. Contract notes for the next renewal\n- Cascade Mutual has the shortest window and the shortest timely filing limit in the network. Managed Care Contracting will ask for a first-level window of at least 90 days at the renewal that starts 2027-01-01.\n- Northstar Advantage requires that every appeal of a \"Medical necessity\" denial include a peer-to-peer request. The payer's clock does not start until the request is logged in its portal.\n- Evergreen Health Plan accepts corrected claims for 365 days; these are not appeals.",
