                "snippet": "Payer Contract Summary: Denials and Appeals\n**Effective**, RHN-CON-009 = 2026-07-01. **Effective**, **Version** = **Review by**. **Effective**, 2026.3 = 2027-01-01. **Owner**, RHN-CON-009 = Managed Care Contracting and Denials Management. **Owner**, **Version** = Managed Care Contracting and Denials Management. **Owner**, 2026.3 = Managed Care Contracting and Denials Management. **Approved by**, RHN-CON-009 = Revenue Cycle Committee. **Approved by**, **Version** = Revenue Cycle Committee. **Approved by**, 2026.3 = Revenue Cycle Committee. **Applies to**, RHN-CON-009 = Claims for services delivered at all Riverside Health Network facilities. **Applies to**, **Version** = Claims for services delivered at all Riverside Health Network facilities. **Applies to**, 2026.3 = Claims for services delivered at all Riverside Health Network facilities",
